{"Daniel Reyes|Morning. Here's my card.":0,"Daniel Reyes|Daniel. Daniel Reyes.":1,"me_m|What's your name?":2,"me_f|What's your name?":3,"Daniel Reyes|Port Alder. It's gone now. The whole town.":4,"me_m|Where are you from?":5,"me_f|Where are you from?":6,"Daniel Reyes|My parents are inside. In the old town. I hope.":7,"me_m|Why do you want to come in?":8,"me_f|Why do you want to come in?":9,"Daniel Reyes|Clothes, water, a photo of my mom. That's all.":10,"me_m|What's in your bag?":11,"me_f|What's in your bag?":12,"Daniel Reyes|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":13,"me_m|Have you seen a Thai girl? Her name is {S}.":14,"me_f|Have you seen a Thai girl? Her name is {S}.":15,"Grace Okafor|Good morning, dear. I... I lost my card. When we ran from the city.":16,"Grace Okafor|I understand. Rules are rules. I'll find a way, dear.":17,"Grace Okafor|Grace. Grace Okafor. I was a teacher for forty years.":18,"Grace Okafor|I had it in my coat. Then the coat was gone. Everything was gone.":19,"me_m|Is this your card?":20,"me_f|Is this your card?":21,"Grace Okafor|My daughter lives inside. Please, dear. I just want to see her.":22,"me_m|Do you have family here?":23,"me_f|Do you have family here?":24,"Grace Okafor|A Thai girl? No... no, I don't think so.":25,"Marcus Bell|Hey. Can we make this quick? I've been walking all night.":26,"Marcus Bell|Come on... Please. Where am I supposed to go?":27,"Marcus Bell|Marcus. Marcus Bell.":28,"Marcus Bell|Yeah. Of course it's mine.":29,"Marcus Bell|It's my brother's card. Jonah. He didn't make it. Mine burned with our house.":30,"me_m|This photo doesn't look like you.":31,"me_f|This photo doesn't look like you.":32,"Marcus Bell|There's nothing left out there, man. Nothing.":33,"Marcus Bell|A Thai girl? No... no, I don't think so.":34,"Lena Novak|Hi. I came from the airport. They said the shelter there is full.":35,"Lena Novak|The capital. But I was at the airport when it started.":36,"Lena Novak|The airport isn't safe anymore. Doctors come every day and take people away.":37,"Lena Novak|Just my phone. It doesn't work. And a toothbrush.":38,"Lena Novak|A Thai girl? There were hundreds of people at the airport shelter...":39,"Lena Novak|Maybe I saw her. Maybe not. I'm sorry.":40,"Hassan Ali|Hello. I can fix things. Fences, trucks, anything. Let me help.":41,"Hassan Ali|I was a mechanic for twenty years. Give me a tool and I'll show you.":42,"me_m|What do you do?":43,"me_f|What do you do?":44,"Hassan Ali|My tools. A hammer, nails, some wire. Don't worry, they're only tools.":45,"Hassan Ali|Now I am. My wife was sick before all this. She's at peace now.":46,"me_m|Are you alone?":47,"me_f|Are you alone?":48,"Hassan Ali|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":49,"Tom Hughes|Morning. Long line today, huh?":50,"Tom Hughes|Sure. Here. Nothing on me, see?":51,"me_m|Can you roll up your sleeves?":52,"me_f|Can you roll up your sleeves?":53,"Tom Hughes|Just tired. And hungry. Mostly hungry.":54,"me_m|Are you hurt?":55,"me_f|Are you hurt?":56,"Tom Hughes|Norra. Up north. It took me nine days to get here.":57,"Tom Hughes|No. I hope you find her.":58,"Victor Kane|Here. My card. Let's be fast, okay?":59,"Victor Kane|You're killing me! You know that?!":60,"Victor Kane|Why? It's freezing out here. I'm just cold.":61,"Victor Kane|No. I'm fine. Can I go now?":62,"Victor Kane|No.":63,"me_m|Were you bitten?":64,"me_f|Were you bitten?":65,"Victor Kane|It's... it's from a dog. A dog bit me. It's not one of them, I swear!":66,"me_m|What happened to your arm?":67,"me_f|What happened to your arm?":68,"Victor Kane|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":69,"Ruth Abara|Oh, my knees... Good morning, young one.":70,"Ruth Abara|At my age? Sure, dear. Look all you want.":71,"Ruth Abara|Sell Bay. But I was at the airport shelter for two weeks.":72,"Ruth Abara|A Thai girl... yes! At the airport shelter, two days ago.":73,"Ruth Abara|She was asking everyone about her family. She said her name was {S}.":74,"Ruth Abara|She looked tired, but she was alive. She was alive, dear.":75,"Sun-hee Park|Hello. This is my son, Jae. We've been walking for four days.":76,"Sun-hee Park|Of course. Jae, show them your arms too. Good boy.":77,"Sun-hee Park|My husband, Min-jun. He stayed behind to help an old man. He's one day behind us. Maybe two.":78,"Sun-hee Park|For Jae. He needs a safe place to sleep.":79,"Sun-hee Park|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":80,"Priya Nair|Thank you... thank you. That thing... it was so close.":81,"Priya Nair|You can't send me back out there! Please!":82,"Priya Nair|I cut it on the fence when I was running. It's not a bite, look!":83,"Priya Nair|No! It didn't touch me. I swear.":84,"Priya Nair|No. I hope you find her.":85,"Father Michael|Bless you for standing here. I'm Father Michael. I've come to help, not to be helped.":86,"Father Michael|Michael Dunne. But everyone calls me Father Michael.":87,"Father Michael|Tired in the soul, my child. But the body is well.":88,"me_m|Do you feel sick?":89,"me_f|Do you feel sick?":90,"Father Michael|No. I'm sorry.":91,"Grace Okafor|I'm back, dear! A man in the camp found my card in the mud. Can you believe it?":92,"Grace Okafor|Only wet. Two nights in the rain will do that.":93,"Grace Okafor|Here you go. Old and wrinkly, but no bites.":94,"Sofia Marin|*cough* Sorry. It's just the flu. I've had it for days.":95,"Sofia Marin|I just wanted a bed... one night in a real bed.":96,"Sofia Marin|Just a cold. Really. I'm fine.":97,"Sofia Marin|Since yesterday. Or... the day before. I don't remember.":98,"me_m|How long have you had a fever?":99,"me_f|How long have you had a fever?":100,"Sofia Marin|No! God, no.":101,"Sofia Marin|...It was dark. Something grabbed me. I thought it was a person.":102,"Sofia Marin|I'm not sick. I'm not!":103,"me_m|What's that on your neck?":104,"me_f|What's that on your neck?":105,"Sofia Marin|No. I hope you find her.":106,"Antonio Rossi|Good morning, my friend! Terrible weather, no? Antonio Rossi. Businessman.":107,"Antonio Rossi|Business, of course. People inside need things. I bring things.":108,"Antonio Rossi|Watches, cigarettes, and medicine. Good medicine. The best.":109,"Antonio Rossi|No. I hope you find her.":110,"rossi|Leo is with me. He lost his card. It happens, yes?":111,"rossi|Listen. I have antibiotics. Real ones. You let Leo in, the medicine is yours.":112,"rossi|Your sergeant has a bad cough. He needs it more than me.":113,"Leo|Leo.":114,"Leo|Don't have one.":115,"Leo|Fine. Look.":116,"Leo|No. I hope you find her.":117,"Dr. Elena Ward|Dr. Elena Ward. Velmora Health Research.":118,"Dr. Elena Ward|I have orders from Command. My vehicle is not to be searched.":119,"Dr. Elena Ward|Medical supplies. That's all you need to know.":120,"me_m|What's in the van?":121,"me_f|What's in the van?":122,"Dr. Elena Ward|The airport. We run a clinic there.":123,"Dr. Elena Ward|I don't know anyone by that name.":124,"Nadia Hassan|Hello. I work at the power plant. They called all the workers back.":125,"Nadia Hassan|I'm tired, that's all. Thirty hours on my feet.":126,"Nadia Hassan|Go ahead. Only burns from work.":127,"Nadia Hassan|I keep the lights on. Without us, this whole city goes dark.":128,"Nadia Hassan|No. I'm sorry.":129,"Omar Farouk|Good morning. ID and permit. I waited two days in the camp for this paper.":130,"Omar Farouk|Yes, here. Valid until the eighteenth.":131,"me_m|Do you have an entry permit?":132,"me_f|Do you have an entry permit?":133,"Omar Farouk|Of course. Nothing there.":134,"Omar Farouk|There were so many people... I really don't know.":135,"Hana Kowalski|Please. My baby has a fever. She needs a doctor.":136,"Hana Kowalski|They told me to get a permit in the camp, but the line is three days long.":137,"Hana Kowalski|No. Not yet. I tried, I really tried.":138,"Hana Kowalski|Six months. Her name is Lily.":139,"me_m|How old is your baby?":140,"me_f|How old is your baby?":141,"Hana Kowalski|No! No, it's a normal fever. She's been sick since before all this. Please.":142,"me_m|Was the baby bitten?":143,"me_f|Was the baby bitten?":144,"Hana Kowalski|No. I'm sorry.":145,"Min-jun Park|Please. I walked for three days to get here.":146,"Min-jun Park|My wife and my boy... Sun-hee and Jae Park. Are they here?":147,"Min-jun Park|It's nothing. I cut it on a fence. Look, it's not a bite.":148,"Min-jun Park|It's the walk. Three days. Anyone would be hot.":149,"Min-jun Park|...Please. Don't make me. Not in front of my son.":150,"Min-jun Park|It happened last night. In the dark. I just wanted to see them one more time.":151,"me_m|Take off the bandage, please.":152,"me_f|Take off the bandage, please.":153,"Min-jun Park|No. I'm sorry.":154,"Paul Grant|Paul Grant. Here are my papers. They're all in order, I assure you.":155,"Paul Grant|This is ridiculous. I'll be back with a new one.":156,"Paul Grant|Expired? That's impossible. They gave it to me yesterday!":157,"me_m|This permit has expired.":158,"me_f|This permit has expired.":159,"Paul Grant|I have an apartment inside. I simply want to go home.":160,"Paul Grant|There were so many people... I really don't know.":161,"Antonio Rossi|Hello again. See? A permit. All official.":162,"Antonio Rossi|Right there. Valid until the twentieth.":163,"Antonio Rossi|Stamp, no stamp... it's paper, my friend. Paper is paper.":164,"me_m|There is no stamp on this permit.":165,"me_f|There is no stamp on this permit.":166,"Antonio Rossi|My friend! We do business again, yes?":167,"Antonio Rossi|Food for your friends inside. Cigarettes for the sergeant. You just stamp, I just walk.":168,"Jack Doyle|Let's go, let's go. You hear that? They're coming.":169,"Jack Doyle|Stuff. Food. A gun, but it's empty, I swear.":170,"Jack Doyle|That? Traded it at the airport. A Thai girl. She gave it to me for a can of beans.":171,"me_m|Where did you get this bracelet?":172,"me_f|Where did you get this bracelet?":173,"Jack Doyle|She looked scared. Some doctors came in a van and took a group of kids. She went with them.":174,"Jack Doyle|Look, I'm sorry. Can I go now? Please?":175,"me_m|Was she okay? Where did she go?":176,"me_f|Was she okay? Where did she go?":177,"Jack Doyle|No. I hope you find her.":178,"Ben Torres|Mom... I don't feel good.":179,"Ben Torres|Everything is... loud. And hot. So hot.":180,"Ben Torres|A man grabbed me this morning. At the camp. I pushed him off. I'm fine...":181,"maria|It's nothing! It's nothing!":182,"Ben Torres|No. I hope you find her.":183,"Maria Torres|Please. Just tell me he'll be safe in there.":184,"Maria Torres|Look. Look! I'm clean. Just let me be near my son.":185,"Maria Torres|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":186,"Samuel Okoye|I ran the last two kilometers. They're right behind the hill. Please!":187,"Samuel Okoye|Here! Nothing! Look fast!":188,"Samuel Okoye|I haven't seen anyone like that. Sorry.":189,"carter|You're the new volunteer? {P}, right?":190,"carter|I'm Sergeant Carter. This is Checkpoint Seven. The last way into Haven.":191,"carter|Your job is simple. People come to that window. You check them. You decide.":192,"carter|Today there is one rule. No card, no entry. And the face must match the photo.":193,"carter|Your English isn't great, huh? That's fine. Listen, look, learn fast.":194,"carter|And {P}... if you let the wrong person in, people die. Don't forget that.":195,"min|Hey, you survived your first day! I'm Min. I run the radio.":196,"min|Carter looks scary, but he's a good man. He lost his whole unit in the first week.":197,"min|So why did you volunteer? Most people only come for the food.":198,"min|Your sister... {S}. I listen to the radio every night. I'll listen for her name. I promise.":199,"carter|That old woman with no card. She's sleeping on the bridge tonight.":200,"carter|You did the right thing. It doesn't feel like it. It never does.":201,"carter|First one is easy. Look at the card. Then look at his face.":202,"carter|Good. That's how it's done.":203,"carter|No? His card was fine, {P}. Be careful.":204,"carter|Remember the rule, {P}.":205,"carter|{P}. No card means no entry. I'll let it go. Once.":206,"min|Bad news. Last night Checkpoint Four let in a man with a bite.":207,"min|He turned in a shelter. Twelve people are dead.":208,"min|Oh, and that man with his brother's card? Marcus? He's fine. He's working in the kitchen now.":209,"carter|New rule. Everyone shows their arms and neck. A bite takes one day to turn you. One day.":210,"carter|People will hide it. They'll lie to your face. Don't let them.":211,"diaz|Sarge... you know what to do. Don't let me become one of them.":212,"carter|...I know, Diaz. I know.":213,"min|She was my friend. Diaz was my friend.":214,"carter|The man with the long sleeves. Victor. You were right about him.":215,"carter|He would have done that inside. To children.":216,"min|An old woman saw {S} at the airport shelter? That's great news!":217,"min|I'll try to reach the airport tonight. No promises. The signal is bad.":218,"diaz|Runner! Runner on the bridge!":219,"carter|Close the gate when they're through! Not before!":220,"carter|Damn it, {P}! They were right there!":221,"diaz|It got me... Sarge, it got my arm.":222,"carter|Good timing. Good.":223,"carter|New rule, {P}. Check his arms and neck.":224,"jae|Mom, will Dad find us?":225,"sunhee|He will, baby. He always does.":226,"sunhee|Please... he's just a child!":227,"min|The man with the long sleeves... Victor? He turned at three in the morning. In the shelter.":228,"min|Three people died before the soldiers stopped him. One of them was a little girl.":229,"carter|That's on us, {P}. On you.":230,"min|They buried the two people from the gate this morning.":231,"carter|Command sent us thermometers. A bite gives you a fever before it turns you.":232,"carter|Thirty-eight or higher, they stay out.":233,"carter|And look at their eyes. Red eyes, shaking hands. That means it's close. Very close.":234,"min|A list with {S}'s name on it? \"Transferred\"... to the research center?":235,"min|The Haven Research Center is inside the walls, on the north side. If she's there, she's inside, {P}. Inside!":236,"min|But why was she in a van with... those people?":237,"min|That van today... I've seen it before. Every two days. Always from the airport.":238,"min|Nobody checks it. Nobody asks. I don't like it, {P}.":239,"Grace Okafor|Thank you, dear. You were right to send me away. And right to let me in.":240,"Antonio Rossi|My associate is next. Be nice to him, eh?":241,"rossi|Pleasure doing business with you.":242,"rossi|Shame. You'll remember this, kid.":243,"carter|Open it, Doctor. My checkpoint, my rules.":244,"|Subject 14: {S}. Female, 17. Airport Shelter. Status: transferred.":245,"Dr. Elena Ward|You don't understand what we're doing. We're trying to find a cure.":246,"carter|No. Let her through, {P}. That's an order.":247,"min|Last night... the camp inside. Someone you let in turned.":248,"min|Command is furious. From today, everyone needs a permit.":249,"min|The city is full. Command says from today, everyone needs an entry permit.":250,"min|Oh, and Rossi was asking about you. He called you his \"friend\". Be careful with him.":251,"carter|Check the date on every permit. Old permits are worth nothing.":252,"carter|We also have one quarantine tent. One person per day. Use it well.":253,"carter|Whoever goes in there... we watch them for a day. If they turn, we deal with it.":254,"min|Shots in the family tents! Oh God... it's the Parks. It's the Parks!":255,"carter|He turned. Alone. Nobody else got hurt.":256,"carter|I'll tell his wife in the morning. That's my job, not yours.":257,"sunhee|You killed him! You left him out there!":258,"carter|Permit first. Check the name, the number, and the date.":259,"Hana Kowalski|Thank you! Thank you! God bless you!":260,"Hana Kowalski|She won't last three days out here...":261,"Hana Kowalski|A tent? With a doctor? Oh, thank you...":262,"sunhee|Min-jun! Min-jun, you made it!":263,"jae|Dad! Dad!":264,"Min-jun Park|Thank you... thank you.":265,"sunhee|No! No, please! He's my husband!":266,"Min-jun Park|It's okay. It's okay, Sun-hee. Take care of Jae.":267,"sunhee|Quarantine? He'll be okay? He'll be okay, right?":268,"carter|...We'll see.":269,"Antonio Rossi|I knew you were smart.":270,"Antonio Rossi|You're making a big mistake, kid. Big.":271,"min|Min-jun turned at midnight. He bit Sun-hee before the soldiers came.":272,"min|Jae is alive. He saw everything. He hasn't said a word since.":273,"min|Carter told Sun-hee about her husband. She just held Jae and didn't let go.":274,"min|They found a woman and a baby on the bridge this morning. They... didn't make it.":275,"min|Good news, at least. Hana's baby is getting better. The doctor says it was just an ear infection.":276,"min|And... drones saw a horde. Thousands of them. Ten kilometers away.":277,"min|They'll hit the bridge before sunset.":278,"carter|We take who we can. When I say close, we close. For good.":279,"carter|Work fast, {P}. But don't work stupid.":280,"maria|Please, he's just tired! He's only sixteen!":281,"maria|Then I stay with him. I'm not leaving my son.":282,"maria|A tent? I can see him? Okay... okay.":283,"maria|Ben? Ben!":284,"carter|{P}! He had a fever of thirty-nine! What were you thinking?!":285,"carter|CLOSE THE GATE! NOW!":286,"radio|This is Airport Shelter... anyone... can anyone hear...":287,"carter|You did good, {P}. Better than good.":288,"carter|Min found the airport channel. Take it. Go find your sister.":289,"min|{P}! They're inside! They're— ":290,"carter|Take the radio and GO! Back door! GO!":291,"carter|I'll hold them! Get Min out of here!":292,"carter|Rossi told everyone. \"The volunteer at Seven takes good payment.\"":293,"carter|You sold my gate, {P}. Get out. You're done here.":294}